stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed

    Closed --> Closed : Success() — failures reset to 0
    Closed --> Open : Failure() — failures ≥ threshold (default 5)

    Open --> Open : Allow() before openUntil — return ErrCircuitOpen
    Open --> HalfOpen : Allow() after openUntil elapses (default 60s)\nBot safe-idle during Open: no new orders placed

    HalfOpen --> Closed : Success() — resume normal operation
    HalfOpen --> Open : Failure() — reopen, reset timer
